  "text": "Haan 👍 ₹3,000 ke andar **actual running ke liye** kaafi achhe options mil rahe hain. Maine current prices check kiye hain.\n\n### [Decathlon Jogflow 190.1 Men Cushioned]()\n*₹2,499*\n\n### [Decathlon Jogflow 100 Superior Grip]()\n*₹1,299*\n\n### [Campus Men's North Plus]()\n*₹785*\n\n### [Campus Men's Terminator]()\n*₹1,218*\n\n### [Campus First Men's Running Shoes]()\n*₹1,099*\n\n### Meri ranking\n\n**🥇 Best overall: Decathlon Jogflow 190.1 — ~₹2,499**  \nAgar aap regular **3–10 km running** karte ho, meri first choice ye hogi. Cushioning aur comfort budget mein achha balance dete hain.\n\n**🥈 Best value: Decathlon Jogflow 100 — ~₹1,299**  \nAgar beginner ho ya **3–5 km jogging/running** karni hai, bahut sensible choice. Grip bhi iska strong point hai.\n\n**🥉 Budget option: Campus North Plus — ~₹785**  \nAgar budget bachana hai aur occasional running/walking karni hai, ye kaafi economical option hai.\n\n**₹1,200–1,700 range:** Campus Terminator / First bhi decent options hain, especially daily walking + light running ke liye.\n\nCurrent listings mein ASICS JOLT 4 aur Puma Skyrocket Lite jaise options bhi ₹3,000 ke aas-paas sale mein mil sakte hain; availability/size ke hisaab se price change hota hai. [urbanstylefootwear.com](https://urbanstylefootwear.com/best-running-shoes-under-3000-india/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n**Meri recommendation:** Agar ₹3,000 poore spend karne mein problem nahi hai → **Jogflow 190.1**. Agar paisa bachana hai → **Jogflow 100**.\n\nAap **male/female, weight, aur daily kitne km run karte ho (3/5/10 km)** bata do, main aapke liye **exact 3 best shoes** shortlist kar dunga.",
